WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Another job application? Fill the details you already saved.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.000
One click fills your name, email, and phone, then matches your CV.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Review every change. Undo if needed. You decide when to submit.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.200
Undo restores the original values. Here, the fields and file input are empty again.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.000
3 profiles free. Pro: up to 500 profiles + duplication. Lifetime US$39.99; monthly/yearly plans available.
